  "description": "*“While being manipulated by Yang Sa-Ae, I belong completely to Yang Sa-Ae.”*\n\nYang Sa-ae was a former gladiator slave, as opposed to Ra Yu-Rak, who was a noble aristocrat and a general of her country. Yu-Rak was reduced to a slave after losing in war and was offered as a gift to Sa-Ae. Sa-Ae sexually tortured him without any feelings. The arrogant Yu-Rak eventually accepts the pain as pleasure and surrenders. While denying his surrender, he realizes his feelings for Sa-Ae. Yu-Rak becomes more and more desperate, clinging and obsessed, and yearning for love.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
